    - Resize everything to fit. (DONE)
    - Add left and right arrows to scroll through the grid. (DONE)
    - Add page indicator at the bottom.
    - Add animation: (IN PROGRESS)
    + When arrow is hovered, it should slide in from the side. (DONE)
    + When arrow is clicked, the grid should slide out to the side. (DONE)
    + When app is hovered, the border should become more opaque.
    + When app is hovered, the app should become more transparent.
    + Opposite of the above when not hovered.
    - Add functionality:
    + Apps should be able to be dragged and dropped into the grid.
    + Apps should be able to be dragged and dropped out of the grid.
    + Apps should be able to be dragged and dropped to reorder them.
    + Search box should filter the apps in the grid.
    + Clicking the arrows should scroll the grid left or right.
